#: source/command-ref/new-cli/nix3-nar-cat.md:1
msgid ""
"**Warning**   \n"
"This program is [**experimental**](../../development/experimental-"
"features.md#xp-feature-nix-command) and its interface is subject to change."
msgstr ""

#: source/command-ref/new-cli/nix3-nar-cat.md:6
msgid "Name"
msgstr ""

#: source/command-ref/new-cli/nix3-nar-cat.md:8
msgid ""
"`nix nar cat` - print the contents of a file inside a NAR file on stdout"
msgstr ""

#: source/command-ref/new-cli/nix3-nar-cat.md:10
msgid "Synopsis"
msgstr "概要"

#: source/command-ref/new-cli/nix3-nar-cat.md:12
msgid "`nix nar cat` \\[_option_...\\] _nar_ _path_"
msgstr ""

#: source/command-ref/new-cli/nix3-nar-cat.md:14
msgid "Examples"
msgstr ""

#: source/command-ref/new-cli/nix3-nar-cat.md:16
msgid ""
"List a file in a [Nix Archive (NAR)](../../store/file-system-object/content-"
"address.md#serial-nix-archive) and pipe it through `gunzip`:"
msgstr ""

#: source/command-ref/new-cli/nix3-nar-cat.md:18
msgid ""
"```console\n"
"# nix nar cat ./hello.nar /share/man/man1/hello.1.gz | gunzip\n"
".\\\" DO NOT MODIFY THIS FILE!  It was generated by help2man 1.46.4.\n"
".TH HELLO \"1\" \"November 2014\" \"hello 2.10\" \"User Commands\"\n"
"…\n"
"```"
msgstr ""

#: source/command-ref/new-cli/nix3-nar-cat.md:25
msgid "Description"
msgstr ""

#: source/command-ref/new-cli/nix3-nar-cat.md:27
msgid ""
"This command prints on standard output the contents of the regular file "
"_path_ inside the NAR file _nar_."
msgstr ""

